{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"controller","type":"text","text":"## `AGGYGOBossAIController`\n\n**阶段 B 已实现**：\n- 持久 Controller\n- 启动 / 暂停同一 Brain / BehaviorTree\n- 显式 Possess 当前 Avatar\n\n**阶段 D 再加入**：\n- Perception\n- ThreatComponent\n- CombatTargetComponent\n\n换形态时不 Cleanup Brain，目标和仇恨不会放进 Pawn。","x":-1925,"y":-560,"width":490,"height":400,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"target","type":"text","text":"## 感知、仇恨与目标\n\nPerception 只产出候选者。\nThreat 维护服务器权威仇恨表。\nCombatTarget 暴露统一当前目标。\n\n约 0.6 ± 0.2 秒重评估目标；追踪/移动仍走 PathFollowing + CMC，不新增全局 Tick 调度器。","x":-1925,"y":20,"width":490,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt","type":"text","text":"## BehaviorTree：只做决策\n\n通用外层：Idle / Sense / AcquireTarget / Combat / LeaveBattle\n\nBoss 战斗子树：\n- 距离、角度、阶段、形态过滤\n- 动态权重选择语义 ActionTag\n- 无合适动作时追击/调整站位\n\nBlackboard 只保留 Target、Home、Distance、Angle、DesiredAction 等少量可观察事实，不堆 `ShouldXxx`。","x":-1120,"y":420,"width":530,"height":430,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"gas","type":"text","text":"## GAS 执行层\n\nBoss GA 使用 `ServerInitiated`：\n- Montage / GameplayEvent\n- 近战判定 / 投射物\n- GE / GameplayCue\n- Cost / Cooldown\n- 激活组与取消\n\n所有形态技能启动时一次性授予；用 `Phase.*` / `Form.*` Tag 控制激活。\n**冷却只有 GAS 一份真相**，BT 不再维护重复冷却。","x":600,"y":400,"width":500,"height":440,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"avatars","type":"text","text":"## 形态 Pawn / Avatar\n\n每个形态可以有独立：\n- PawnClass、骨骼与 AnimBP\n- 碰撞与 CMC 配置\n- PawnExtension / HealthComponent\n- 形态专属表现组件\n\nPawn 只消费 BossState 注入的 ASC。\n换形态不是死亡，旧 Pawn 不发 `Event.Death`。","x":600,"y":-560,"width":480,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"guardrails","type":"text","text":"## 明确禁止\n\n- 不把 Boss 塞进玩家 CharacterSlot\n- 不让 BT 直接播 Montage、扣血或改 Tag\n- 不同时在 BT 与 GAS 维护冷却\n- 不用几十个布尔 Blackboard Key 复制隐式状态机\n- 不在 Form Pawn 上保存跨形态状态\n- 不让 Controller、Pawn 与 BossState 多方调用 `InitAbilityActorInfo`\n- 不新建全局每帧调度器\n\n详细验收清单见 [[计划_BOSSAI#15. 审阅后冻结的检查项]]。","x":-1960,"y":635,"width":560,"height":440,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"← [[计划蓝图|返回计划总入口]]　·　文字说明见 [[计划_BOSSAI]]\n\n# Boss AI 架构（实施中）\n\n**阶段 A/B 的宿主、最小装配与单机 PIE 验收已落地；C–F 仍是计划。**\n\n核心目标：Boss 换 Pawn 形态时，ASC、属性、Buff、冷却、阶段、目标与仇恨连续；行为树只决定做什么，GAS 决定能不能做并负责执行。","x":-2275,"y":-1275,"width":700,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"principles","type":"text","text":"## 宿主选择原则\n\n不是“怪物必须复用玩家 Slot”。\n\n- 玩家编队：`AGGYGOCharacterSlot`\n- 可换 Pawn 的 Boss：`AGGYGOBossState`\n- 普通怪物：Pawn 自持 ASC 仍可接受\n\n判断标准只有一个：**战斗状态要活多久**。\nPawn 会被替换而状态要保留，才把状态宿主上移。","x":-1355,"y":-975,"width":500,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"combatant","type":"text","text":"## `AGGYGOCombatantState`（已实现）\n\n最小抽象基类：\n- ASC\n- HealthSet / CombatSet\n- 复制 Avatar 引用\n- Attach / Detach 唯一入口\n- Avatar 销毁自动清理\n\n**不包含**队伍、AI、阶段、仇恨或 Boss 业务。\n`CharacterSlot` 与 `BossState` 只复用这一小段生命周期机制。","x":-440,"y":-1005,"width":500,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"slot","type":"text","text":"## 玩家分支\n\n`AGGYGOCharacterSlot : AGGYGOCombatantState`\n\n保留现有语义：\n- Owner = PlayerController\n- ASC = Mixed\n- PawnData / 队伍位置\n- 玩家预测\n\n这是对现有 D1 的抽取，不把队伍语义下沉到基类。","x":635,"y":-1350,"width":430,"height":345,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"network","type":"text","text":"## 权威与复制\n\n服务器权威：决策、仇恨、Phase、Form、Avatar、伤害。\n\n复制给客户端：\n- BossState / Avatar\n- CurrentPhase / CurrentForm\n- ASC Tag / GE / Cue / 属性\n- 过渡状态与必要表现事件\n\n客户端只表现，不预测 Boss 决策。Boss ASC 用 Minimal；玩家 Slot 继续 Mixed。","x":1440,"y":430,"width":510,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bossstate","type":"text","text":"## Boss 状态宿主\n\n`AGGYGOBossState : AGGYGOCombatantState`\n\n持有：\n- BossDefinition\n- CurrentPhase / CurrentForm\n- 一次性机制状态\n- Minimal ASC\n\n不持有：\n- BehaviorTree\n- 感知/仇恨\n- PathFollowing\n\nASC 与属性只授予一次，换形态不重授予。","x":1520,"y":-1045,"width":430,"height":470,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"handoff","type":"text","text":"## Avatar Handoff（阶段 E 计划）\n\n1. 激活不可重入的 Exit/Transition Ability\n2. 加 `State.Boss.Transforming`，阻断普通行动\n3. 冻结移动与受击边界，生成新 Pawn\n4. 旧 PawnExtension 清理绑定\n5. BossState 通过唯一 AttachAvatar 入口切换\n6. 同一 Controller Possess 新 Pawn，恢复 Target / Path\n7. 更新 Form Tag，激活 Enter Ability\n8. 成功后销毁旧 Pawn并解除阻断\n\n失败则回滚旧 Avatar；任何时刻只有 BossState 能写 Avatar。","x":2440,"y":250,"width":540,"height":560,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"encounter","type":"text","text":"## `AGGYGOBossEncounter`（阶段 B）\n\n关卡中的最小装配入口：\n1. 初始化 BossState\n2. Deferred Spawn 初始 Avatar\n3. 注入 PawnData 与 ASC\n4. FinishSpawning\n5. 持久 AIController Possess\n\n`/Game/AI/Boss/Test/` 已配置单 Form/单 Phase 样例和独立 PIE 测试图。\n\n不负责技能选择、仇恨、奖励或转阶段。","x":2450,"y":-1045,"width":520,"height":440,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"definition","type":"text","text":"## 数据定义\n\n**阶段 B 已实现**：\n`BossDefinition`\n- 持久 AbilitySet / BehaviorTree\n- 初始 Phase / Form\n- Form/PhaseDefinition 列表\n\n`BossFormDefinition`\n- FormTag / AvatarPawnData\n\n`BossPhaseDefinition`\n- PhaseTag / 生命阈值\n\nActionSet、Exit/Enter 与目标参数在后续阶段加入；Phase 与 Form 始终正交。","x":3360,"y":-1075,"width":520,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bridge","type":"text","text":"## 决策 → GAS 桥\n\n`BTTask_ChooseBossAction`\n输出语义 ActionTag / AbilityHandle。\n\n`BTTask_ActivateBossAbility`\n向 ASC 请求激活，并等待 Ability 结束/取消。\n\nAI **不伪造 InputTag**，不调用玩家的 `ProcessAbilityInput`。\nGAS 的 TagRequirements、Cost、Cooldown、组仲裁才是最终准入。","x":-280,"y":435,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"2"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e-principles-combatant","fromNode":"principles","fromSide":"right","toNode":"combatant","toSide":"left","label":"仅抽取共同生命周期"},
